WEBVTT

00:01:59.812 --> 00:02:03.193
WH: I've been saying this since I first
ran for Congress back in 2009,

00:02:03.217 --> 00:02:04.407
this is not a new topic,

00:02:04.431 --> 00:02:07.019
that building a 30-foot-high
concrete structure

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:08.687
from sea to shining sea

00:02:08.711 --> 00:02:11.545
is the most expensive
and least effective way

00:02:11.569 --> 00:02:13.117
to do border security.

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:15.870
There are parts of the border

00:02:15.894 --> 00:02:19.180
where Border Patrol's
response time to a threat

00:02:19.204 --> 00:02:21.831
is measured in hours to days.

00:02:21.855 --> 00:02:25.655
If your response time
is measured in hours to days,

00:02:25.679 --> 00:02:28.369
then a wall is not a physical barrier.

00:02:28.671 --> 00:02:30.932
We should be having technology
along the border,